{
  "bodyHash": "b767981e578c4578",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zuMquLR.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/gatekeep06/Cobblenav?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black\" alt=\"GitHub 授權\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/repository-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\" alt=\"儲存庫\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/wiki-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\" alt=\"維基\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgatekeep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/support me-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&labelColor=black\" alt=\"贊助我\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>關於模組</h1>\n<p>Cobblenav 模組的靈感來自《Pokémon RSE》與《Pokémon ORAS》中的道具及相關機制。此模組新增了 PokéNav，讓你能夠查詢目前所在區域可能出現的寶可夢種類、出現機率以及影響其出現的因素。此外，模組還支援使用三維箭頭或名為 PokéFinder 的雷達道具來追蹤目標寶可夢。本模組持續積極開發中，每月都會新增新功能。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">使用指南</span></strong><br><br>以下為維基頁面連結，您可在此查詢合成配方、指令、設定檔以及擴充模組開發等相關資訊。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/1.-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zGU6qw1.png\" alt=\"配方\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/2.-Commands\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xE3IoSv.png\" alt=\"指令\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/3.-Configuration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lJssyXW.png\" alt=\"設定\"> </a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OZ4Z7Tu.png\" alt=\"擴充模組\"></a><br>如果您是開發者，可能會對模組提供的 <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">API 文件</a> 感興趣。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\">功能特色</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">位置畫面</span></strong><br><br>PokéNav 會告訴您在目前位置可能看到哪些寶可夢。<br>準確度保證！</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/74I9DRg.png\" alt=\"位置\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">搜尋畫面</span></strong><br><br>使用 PokéNav 在您的區域內尋找最棒的寶可夢！</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4HfT8SR.png\" alt=\"搜尋器\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">並將其鎖定追蹤！</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y9iIKOx.png\" alt=\"追蹤\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LDOW4HM.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">FishingNav</span></strong><br><br>使用 FishingNav 預測您的漁獲！<br>本模組提供獨特的釣魚生成檢查功能。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cvKVtqd.png\" alt=\"釣魚\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b9rXJB4.png\" alt=\"FishingNav\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">PokéFinder</span></strong><br><br>覺得小地圖不公平或不美觀嗎？使用 PokéFinder！<br>透過這台小型裝置，您將能輕鬆設定並使用雷達功能。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JC9Uxb9.png\" alt=\"PokéFinder\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">擴充模組相容性</span></strong><br><br>本模組與所有使用 Cobblemon 內建寶可夢生成系統的擴充模組完全相容。<br>不確定傳說寶可夢超夢在哪裡出現？交給 PokéNav 吧！</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OLf33cj.png\" alt=\"相容性\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
